  "about": [
    "Which kinds may hold which, written as data: the whole kind \u00d7 kind matrix.",
    "",
    "Both evaluators replay it. `src-tauri/tests/operations/parenting_conformance.rs` asks",
    "`nodes::rules::parenting::may_parent` of every pair; `src/utils/parenting-conformance.test.ts`",
    "asks the frontend's `isValidDropTarget`, which the Mindmap asks per pointer move. Neither side",
    "generates this file.",
    "",
    "`parents` names, for each child kind, every parent kind it may hang under; every pair not",
    "named is refused. A Flow item's parent is in the Flow's own world, and a folded run of Habit",
    "history (`habit_group`) is a drawing that neither moves nor holds anything. The rules are",
    "written out in `docs/spec/resources.md` and `docs/spec/flows.md`."
